&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comments URL: &lt;a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50586349"&gt;https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50586349&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Points: 1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;# Comments: 0&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50586349</guid><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:47:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Show HN: Musset, open-source Scrivener alternative with an AI that never writes</title><link>https://github.com/Musset-App/musset</link><description>&lt;p&gt;I’m writing my first novel and could not find an app that fit my workflow: quiet like iA Writer, organized like Scrivener, and with AI so I can discuss my book while I write it. It allows me to feel less “alone” and have a sounding board while I write.&lt;p&gt;- A book is a folder of plain Markdown files. Musset commits to a git repo, tracks versions and drafts without you having to know git.&lt;p&gt;- Revisions are CriticMarkup inside the text. It manages docx revisions too, so your editor can edit a Word doc and you import their comments.&lt;p&gt;- PDFs are typeset using Typst, embedded in the app, following each language’s typographic rules.&lt;p&gt;- Spelling and grammar are checked using LanguageTool, also embedded.&lt;p&gt;- Mac/Word, WordStar, vi and Emacs keyboard modes.&lt;p&gt;The AI is optional and uses your Codex or Claude Code CLI. It comments, leaves margin notes, and checks continuity and your chapters against your style rules.&lt;p&gt;It’s GPL-3.0 and free during the beta. When or if it reaches 1.0, if there is sufficient interest, the idea is to make it a small one-time payment ($9.90). There is a paid sync service (git hosting) that lets you share a book with beta readers and editors.&lt;p&gt;Download: &lt;a href="https://musset.app" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://musset.app&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;I’d love to have some feedback!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comments URL: &lt;a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50586323"&gt;https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50586323&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
